  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 56230,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/rlangoy/PB1151vSnippets/tree/main/SerialLedBtnLibEx/Usn.Pb1151.DeviceKit",
  "published": "2026-08-06T06:56:32.42Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.2: Small README documentation update; no API changes. 1.1.1: Updated README and package description/project URL; no API changes. 1.1.0: Multi-targeted the package for net10.0-windows and net10.0-windows10.0.17763.0, so it now restores in projects created from the standard WinForms/WPF templates (which target plain net10.0-windows) without editing the consuming project's TargetFramework. On net10.0-windows, everything is available except BleNusEx (BLE requires the WinRT projections only available on the versioned windows10.0.17763.0 TFM); bump the consuming project's TargetFramework to net10.0-windows10.0.17763.0 to use BLE. 1.0.1: Lowered the minimum target Windows version from 10.0.19041.0 to 10.0.17763.0 (Windows 10, version 1809) to relax consuming-project TargetFramework requirements; no API changes. 1.0.0: Initial release. JsonSerialController with LedControl, ServoControl, ButtonControl, and SensorControl (TMP102 temperature, ADXL345 acceleration). Two transports: SerialPortEx (USB serial) and BleNusEx (BLE Nordic UART Service), both behind ISerialDataReadWrite.",
